// YW's plugins for other hosts: THE one table (round 180b). A rename is one edit here: plugin/ExportCatalog.h, the VST3
// wrapper, cmake/YwPlugins.cmake and scripts/build-windows-zig.sh all read this file (one entry per line, keep the format).
// Exported names only: inside YW the engines keep their names. Names were checked by a web search only, with no
// trademark registry check. Once released, the clap id and the code never change: hosts store them in their projects.
//
// name, instrument, effect kind, instrument kind, clap id, VST3 code, VST3 category, built
// built: 0 = not compiled, 1 = in the CLAP only, 2 = in the CLAP and as its own VST3 (the user's option C, 2026-11-08:
// every YW effect in the CLAP, a short list as VST3; round 188b, docs/PLUGIN_EXPORT.md)
